  "label": "User projected onto the textual description of the parenting mishap",
  "description": "The text 'when you've just realised your son has taken the wrong backpack to school' explicitly uses 'your son', which directly addresses the user as a parent. This creates a direct projection of the user onto the textual material, making them the subject of the described scenario. The user is not just observing the scene but is invited to imagine themselves in that exact situation, experiencing the panic and shock described. The projection is onto the 'text_chunk' entity, which contains the deictic reference 'your son'.",
